{"path":"atomic","title":"Atomic operations library","titleHtml":"Atomic operations library","originalUrl":"https://en.cppreference.com/w/c/atomic","section":"","kind":"index","summary":"If the macro constant __STDC_NO_ATOMICS__(C11) is defined by the compiler, the header <stdatomic.h>, the keyword _Atomic, and all of the names listed here are not provided.","html":"<p>If the macro constant <code>__STDC_NO_ATOMICS__</code><span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-c11\">(C11)</span> is defined by the compiler, the header <code>&lt;stdatomic.h&gt;</code>, the keyword <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi c source-c\">_Atomic</span></code>, and all of the names listed here are not provided.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Types\">Types</h3>\n<table class=\"t-dsc-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-dsc-header\">\n<td colspan=\"2\"> <div>Defined in header <code><a href=\"/w/c/thread#Atomic_operations\"><code>&lt;stdatomic.h&gt;</code></a></code> </div>\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/c/atomic/memory_order\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>memory_order</span></span></a></div><div><span class=\"t-lines\"><span><span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-c11\">(C11)</span></span></span></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>   defines memory ordering constraints  <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(enum)</span> </td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td> <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/c/atomic/atomic_flag\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>atomic_flag</span></span></a></div><div><span class=\"t-lines\"><span><span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-c11\">(C11)</span></span></span></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  lock-free atomic boolean flag <br><span class=\"t-mark\">(struct)</span></td></tr>\n</table>\n<h3 id=\"Macros\">Macros</h3>\n<table class=\"t-dsc-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-dsc-header\">\n<td colspan=\"2\"> <div>Defined in header <code><a href=\"/w/c/thread#Atomic_operations\"><code>&lt;stdatomic.h&gt;</code></a></code> </div>\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div clas